{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgssNytzkwDwfk8WSzcXE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`deploy.sh` now removes objects from the bucket that the build no longer produces. I haven't run it against a real bucket, so the S3 filter behaviour is untested. Changes are uncommitted, and the details are in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n**What changed**\n\n- **`deploy.sh`**\n  - The site sync runs `aws s3 sync site/ … --delete` and excludes `s/*` and `a/*`, so it never deletes page keys.\n  - The page upload is now `aws s3 sync .build/pages/ … --delete`, limited to `s/*` and `a/*`. It keeps the `text/html; charset=utf-8` content type and the `max-age=300` cache header, which the extensionless keys need.\n  - The build still runs first under `set -e`, so a failed build stops the deploy before anything is deleted.\n- **`build_pages.py`**: creates the output directory even when no notes are public. Without this, the sync source path would not exist in that case.\n\n**Verification**\n\n- I ran `deploy.sh` with a stub `aws` on `PATH` that only logs its arguments. The build output was correct (3 notes and 2 authors, with the private note left out), and both sync commands had the intended flags.\n- With every note set to private, the build still succeeds and produces an empty directory, so the sync would remove all `s/` and `a/` keys.\n- I did not confirm live S3 behaviour for exclude and include filters combined with `--delete`. Check the first CI run, or run `aws s3 sync --dryrun` against a bucket you own.\n\n**Things to know before merging**\n\n- The site sync's `--delete` removes anything at the bucket root that isn't in `site/` or the build output. Files uploaded by hand will be deleted on the next push to main.\n- Deleting from S3 doesn't purge CloudFront. A removed page can stay live at the edge until its TTL expires. Immediate removal needs a CloudFront invalidation, which I didn't add because it needs the distribution ID and touches an external service."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1691,"cache_read_input_tokens":31506,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1691},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23f59ca9-e094-4cc8-9a5c-43a841349e7f","uuid":"0eb3beeb-dc2e-42a5-bb73-9f5edc718242","timestamp":"2026-11-09T19:00:19.266Z","request_id":"req_011CgssNygqPiDPcL1RjhS8q"}
